          "Reduction returns a total. Exclusive scan returns each prefix before the current item. If flags are zero or one, each kept item can write to the number of kept items preceding it. This gives a stable compaction algorithm. The same count–scan–scatter pattern builds adjacency arrays and tile candidate lists.",
